tock · choices   space turn on/off · enter save · q quit

Tracking
  ● Local model labels           labels activity on this machine
  ● Claude                       suggestions, summaries and tock ask
› ● Screen text         changed  reads the front window; needs Screen Recording
  ○ Calendar meetings            events from macOS Calendar explain idle time

Focus
  ● Notifications                every notice tock sends
  ● Suggestions                  when to start focus or take a break
  ○ Break screen                 covers the screens when a break runs over
  ○ Wake screen                  covers the screens when a session goes off task
  ● Start hotkey                 ⌥⌘F opens a prompt to start focus from any app
  ○ Block distractions           closes distracting tabs and apps in a session
  ○ Urge surfing                 the distraction notice asks what you feel
  ● Notch                        sessions, recaps and labelling in the notch

Day
  ● Start of day                 a notice when your day starts
  ● Evening recap                the day in one notice
  ● Overworking                  a notice when work runs past [hours] end
  ● Plan reminders               up next and starting now, for timed plan items

Other
  ○ Slack status                 status and do-not-disturb during sessions

  ↗ Open dashboard               in your browser, on this machine only

